WEBVTT

00:16:29.094 --> 00:16:31.749
that were built
in the last couple of years.

00:16:32.217 --> 00:16:33.999
From Brazil to India,

00:16:35.167 --> 00:16:36.318
Mexico,

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.573
Alabama,

00:16:41.326 --> 00:16:42.485
China,

00:16:43.825 --> 00:16:44.979
Israel,

00:16:45.003 --> 00:16:46.153
Palestine,

00:16:46.823 --> 00:16:47.973
Vietnam.

00:16:48.306 --> 00:16:52.457
The average age of a designer
who gets involved in this project is 32 --

00:16:52.481 --> 00:16:53.752
that's how old I am.

00:16:53.776 --> 00:16:54.976
So it's a young --

00:16:56.949 --> 00:16:59.597
I just have to stop here,
because Arup is in the room,

00:16:59.621 --> 00:17:01.978
and this is the best-designed
toilet in the world.